// How the enemies scale, tuned while the game runs (task 147). These dials
// are the whole of it: nothing else makes the machines more, more often or
// better armed.
//
// The game reads this file again whenever it is saved (BIMS_SCALING names
// another). The next wave laid and the next site's wave count take the
// new numbers; a wave already standing keeps its size. A field left out is
// the built-in value, and a file that does not parse keeps the last good
// numbers (the reason is printed on the terminal).
//
// "day" is the day the top bar shows, one on the day the run opens.
//
//   a wave        = (enemies_per_player + day_scaling * steps) * players
//                   + enemies_per_defender * defenders, rounded up (at a
//                   defence only; 1.5 and three defenders is five)
//   steps         = whole scaling_days in the day (0: never grows)
//   waves a site  = 1 + whole wave_days in the day (0: always one)
//   tier timings  = the day every enemy has reached that tier; before it
//                   day / timing of them have (half at half the days),
//                   counted in whole enemies, so one at a time
//     tier1_days  — the Manufacturers' gear: the rest carry a pistol alone
//     tier2_days  — the machines and the Manufacturers' gear at tier two
//     tier3_days  — the same at tier three
//                   (0: that tier for everybody from the first day)
//   the Machine Heart is always four waves, every machine tier three
//
// Only player Bims count as players; bots do not.
//
// The game setup's Difficulty shows every dial as this file has them; once
// the host moves one, the run keeps the setup's (saved with it, dealt to
// every guest). The setup's "Save as default" writes its numbers into this
// file, leaving the comments alone.
// The built-in values: enemies_per_player 2, day_scaling 1, scaling_days 5,
// enemies_per_defender 1.0, wave_days 10, tier1_days 5, tier2_days 20,
// tier3_days 40.
(
    enemies_per_player: 2,
    day_scaling: 1,
    scaling_days: 5,
    enemies_per_defender: 1.0,
    wave_days: 10,
    tier1_days: 5,
    tier2_days: 20,
    tier3_days: 40,
)
